pleb (0.2.3+packaging2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * On a packaged install, pleb status and pleb doctor no longer tell the
    operator to run pleb install. pleb update runs apt, and rollback is the
    previous frozen suite. The settings command is /usr/bin/kilix-settings.

 -- itsmygithubacct <itsmygithubacct@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:13:00 +0000

pleb (0.2.3+packaging1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add the pleb package: the tree in /usr/lib/pleb with a PACKAGED marker,
    the session entry, the capture portal, the lid drop-in, the notification
    theme and the recovery guide where a package keeps them.
  * Packaged mode: pleb-session finds its files in the package, `pleb
    install` does the per-user steps only, and `pleb update` and `pleb
    uninstall` defer to apt. A packaged Kilix and Kilix 95 are used when no
    checkout is present.

 -- itsmygithubacct <itsmygithubacct@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:15:00 +0000
